                    "message": "Self-marking this as '-1' but not abandoning it outright in case we want to revisit later.\n\nWe've probably got a better method of handling 'tach display' for 'tachless fans' in the work.\n\nie, connect the fans to chassis in EMConfigs via ports for cooled/cooled_by associations, then if it's a 'tachless fan' fansensor daemon just won't associate the 'tach sensor' records with the chassis.\n\nThat'll be enough to let swampd do what it needs to do with the tach sensor records on dbus, but without displaying those values through redfish/chassis sensors page of bmcweb's webui."
